---
/* Component — PageFooter
 * The page's footer — a stack of two bands: PageFooterMain (brand and nav
 * columns) above PageFooterBottom (copyright, version).
 *
 * A block-axis grid with row-gap spacing-8: the two bands are separated by
 * space alone, with no divider rule. The gap also means a footer carrying only
 * one of the two bands has no stray space.
 *
 * A full-width edge-to-edge band like PageHeader: as a direct child of Page it
 * spans the whole window width on its own, and the sunken fill bleeds edge to
 * edge with it, while the inline padding insets the content — without
 * shrinking the element's own box — so it caps at --bravoixr-page-max and lines
 * up with the page column above. Themes with the page via the semantic dark
 * override. */
---

<footer>
  <slot />
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    display: grid;
    row-gap: var(--bravoixr-spacing-8);
    padding-block: var(--bravoixr-spacing-5);
    padding-inline: max(var(--bravoixr-spacing-10), calc((100% - var(--bravoixr-page-max)) / 2));
    background: var(--bravoixr-color-surface-sunken);
  }
</style>
